        "text_sha256": "68b64c5b2a6b05aee859cf4905da19566d90e94d0f3769464002a9c6cf067008",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "5:00 A.M.: Non-birthing parent goes to bed",
        "text_sha256": "08298b8b56bfccf7549dc51754d7c09c7a427b647638052658c67434dbdd3531",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000040",
        "block_index": 40,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "7:00 A.M.: Mom breastfeeds baby",
        "text_sha256": "dc6569426a4df8b123d622db6a25e8d18b4fc41e0e409ba840d2d064e8bc1ec1",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000041",
        "block_index": 41,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "(Note: This schedule assumes baby is a breast- and formula-fed newborn who is eating roughly every two to three hours. However, breastfed babies should be fed on demand, so your little one may want to eat more often during the night. It also assumes that it takes about an hour to complete each feeding session, though in reality it may take a little more or less time for everyone to get back to sleep.)",
        "text_sha256": "8fc4eae2b12fbf370c96d84e44e4cce8d94ee30515160f3ac876517fc90ce8f6",
        "word_count": 74
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000042",
        "block_index": 42,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Sample night shift schedule for an exclusive pumping family",
        "text_sha256": "c6f15649ee8d0f67e957184ab829834b72726afb7e681d1d1cb348945cae1acb",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000043",
        "block_index": 43,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Pumping gives both parents the opportunity to feed baby. But even when the non-birthing parent is the one offering the bottle, mom will likely still need to pump during the night in order to maintain her supply.",
        "text_sha256": "b017ad1785c8f86e80159b81c6de2ea0b1cb0926992ef946109b742bdcb84299",
        "word_count": 37
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000044",
        "block_index": 44,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "7:00 P.M.: Mom gives baby a pumped milk bottle after having pumped earlier",
        "text_sha256": "2f1e3f3cc6a69fddf60eb8f3e185f3e145400274e3cc8cd98d70ee52db621da2",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000045",
        "block_index": 45,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
