      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000061",
        "block_index": 61,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "11:00 P.M.: Non-birthing parent goes to bed",
        "text_sha256": "6bc97a63038066f7252533b497b79e06c1ec00670869ec213530fe1dec61126c",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000062",
        "block_index": 62,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1:00 A.M.: Mom breastfeeds baby",
        "text_sha256": "3a32fb59700d1d4ec8fee73eeeda38c27f866e92654e38e8f5b5b3375b244a58",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000063",
        "block_index": 63,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "1:30 A.M.: Mom goes back to bed, non-birthing parent handles diaper changes and burping",
        "text_sha256": "503a777bf072f7e87a82d2ffaec7b335f03354549cabec1d018533822ebe1e52",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000064",
        "block_index": 64,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "2:00 A.M.: Non-birthing parent goes to bed",
        "text_sha256": "7abc5b45d1ff30d4c9a32e7491cc5d2e8d747be3449a9e6f8eb6062727e37780",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000065",
        "block_index": 65,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "4:00 A.M.: Mom breastfeeds baby",
        "text_sha256": "7ecea6babb94f8b60d4349ff03572cef2abdcd97c2c1a2e1bce0ddf9902715ef",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000066",
        "block_index": 66,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "4:30 A.M.: Mom goes back to bed, non-birthing parent handles diaper changes and burping",
        "text_sha256": "2d9ef0716aa03f6a87b9e52e4809e345dec7549d57e6884b98595682650e981e",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000067",
        "block_index": 67,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "5:00 A.M.: Non-birthing parent goes back to bed",
        "text_sha256": "e817a3a25ff9519aebb770ba8061896f70557af4327f0e3749d5fb2ebf1d8991",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000068",
        "block_index": 68,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "7:00 A.M.: Mom breastfeeds baby",
        "text_sha256": "dc6569426a4df8b123d622db6a25e8d18b4fc41e0e409ba840d2d064e8bc1ec1",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000069",
        "block_index": 69,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "(Note: This schedule assumes baby is a breastfed newborn who is eating roughly every two to three hours. However, breastfed babies should be fed on demand, so your little one may want to eat more often than this during the night. It also assumes that it takes about an hour to complete each feeding session, though in reality it may take a little more or less time for everyone to get back to sleep.)",
        "text_sha256": "bbdf98401ab93a1e60420cbeee8186abb070b8ff18ca9af6f0b84b6fada528b1",
        "word_count": 74
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000070",
        "block_index": 70,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Tips for navigating a night shift schedule",
        "text_sha256": "be44b55aea53273a9e21c43aa4f4291052534421fba4959c7b21e16a494b6b86",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000071",
        "block_index": 71,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Taking shifts can take some getting used to. These tips can set the stage for success and help you and your partner log more shuteye.",
        "text_sha256": "074047c236f193b184086dbf490091e770482aa7a9d5e9e14f4a64afbebb9450",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000072",
        "block_index": 72,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Set the schedule ahead of time. Talk about who will take which shift so you know who will be on duty when. That way there's no debating whose turn it is to tackle the diaper change at 3:00 A.M.",
        "text_sha256": "41cebcf1c1a0644ceba80e165abd4b275aea5315aaf513920323b1b04faacdcf",
        "word_count": 39
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000073",
        "block_index": 73,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "But allow for some flexibility. See your plan as a loose set of guidelines rather than a strict schedule. Newborns don't adhere to timelines, so there will be nights when you need to veer off script.",
        "text_sha256": "24cb3cc4009d95742e96a3e58127501a314e0ca2edb3df22b0bb946e3ef90090",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000074",
        "block_index": 74,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Plan to go to bed as soon as the baby does. Especially for breastfeeding moms, you'll max out your snooze time by turning off the lights ASAP after baby eats. If you're having trouble nodding off, make sure you're sticking with good sleep habits like not scrolling through your phone right before bed and avoiding late-afternoon caffeine.",
        "text_sha256": "e0712d02e9d353cb59572a68c7e999ed7cdb2fa5e495478f9f512f7ef121dfca",
        "word_count": 57
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000075",
        "block_index": 75,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Consider sleeping in different rooms. The off-duty parent will get the most restful sleep if they can snooze somewhere quiet.",
        "text_sha256": "fb23663f081ee5c23c280efd0fd0bfe25a8b979cf722d8088aa13d1df7e0a87c",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000076",
        "block_index": 76,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Setting up a night shift schedule can make the best of a bleary-eyed situation. By working together, you and your partner can tackle the late nights (and wee hours) so you both feel a little more rested during the day.",
        "text_sha256": "e59c39971dd3af3da0a6bcf9140e0231bc3fe8017069feb42874973e606345e5",
        "word_count": 40
      }
    ],
